{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" = [","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sequence.Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/element"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"MaximalCliques.Element","modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"symbolKind":"typealias","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L260","fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift"},"roleHeading":"Type Alias","externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V7Elementa","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Element","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"Cliques","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Element":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/element","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Element"}],"title":"MaximalCliques.Element","abstract":[],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Element"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Element"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"Vertex","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"title":"MaximalCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"}}}